id: SC-SEC-011
title: Suspicious npm lifecycle scripts (ua-parser-js/event-stream attacks)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: package.json
  exclude_paths: node_modules/ .git/
patterns:
  - regex: "(?:pre|post)?install"\s*:\s*"(?:node|bash|sh|curl|wget|eval|powershell)
    message: "Lifecycle script executes shell/network command — common supply chain attack vector (ua-parser-js, event-stream)"
fix: Review lifecycle scripts carefully. Use --ignore-scripts during install. Audit with npm audit signatures.